OL,3,GNEWSAThe chef turned award-winning
OL,4,Aauthor unfazed by 'second book
OL,5,Asyndrome'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen your award-winning debut novel is
OL,8,Fadapted into a Bafta-nominated TV
OL,9,Fseries expectations run high for what
OL,10,Fmight come next.
OL,12,FBut Louise Kennedy, the author of
OL,13,FTrespasses, seems unfazed with the
OL,14,Fdaunting notion of what is often called
OL,15,Fsecond book syndrome.
OL,17,FMaybe it's her late entrance to the
OL,18,Fliterary world, working in busy
OL,19,Fkitchens as a chef for decades or
OL,20,Fdealing with a cancer diagnosis that
OL,21,Fhelps Kennedy cope with pressure.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
